abstract: >-
  Open knowledge graph of B2G AI and digital-government opportunities in
  Uzbekistan and Kyrgyzstan. 100 decrees, 105 institutions, 117
  decision-makers, 49 donor programmes, 50 live tenders, 61 trends, 100
  global cases, 100 institutional B2G initiatives, and 200 solopreneur
  MVPs. Built with Claude (Opus + Sonnet) and Perplexity Sonar Deep
  Research on a strict USD 20 OpenRouter budget.
